* New non-invasive Verilog-A aliases; legacy dantenna/dpantenna remain in diodes.lib.
.subckt dantenna_va A K l=780n w=780n m=1
N_DANT_VA A K ihp_dantenna_va area={l*w} perim={2*(l+w)} corners=4 mult={m}
.ends dantenna_va

.subckt dpantenna_va A K l=780n w=780n m=1
N_DPANT_VA A K ihp_dpantenna_va area={l*w} perim={2*(l+w)} corners=4 mult={m}
.ends dpantenna_va

* Common ESD model cards.  Geometry is expressed in SI units for the
* unified model; the public ESD wrappers convert legacy um^2 values.
.model diodevdd_mod ihp_diode_va (
+tnom_c=27 shared_junction=1 gsh=1e-12 is_a=4.911e-7 n_a=1.04 isr_a=5.422e-3
+knee_current_a=1e10 cj0_a=8.716e-4 mj_a=0.3294 vj_a=0.6621
+ibv_a=4.744e-4 bv_a=11.81 nbv_a=1 eg_a=1.11 xti_a=4
+gser_a=3.452e9
+)

